# IIFE with tuple-typed param + tuple literal arg. Before the fix the
# closure's param type resolved to `unit` because the immutable
# `map_ast_type` couldn't register the tuple type on first use, and no
# other site in the program introduced `Tuple__int64_t__int64_t` to the
# registry before the closure was lowered. The body then folded to
# `add unit const unit, const unit` and the call returned 0.

void main():
    int r = (((int, int) p): p._0 + p._1)((3, 4))
    print(r)
